.TH "PACE ACTIVITY EXPORT-RANGE" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace activity export-range Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-activity\-export-range \- Download every activity in a date range to...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace activity export-range
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download every activity in a date range to `--out-dir`.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-F,\fP \-\-from TEXT
Start date (YYYY-MM-DD | -Nd).  [required]
.TP
\fB\-T,\fP \-\-to TEXT
[default: today]
.TP
\fB\-f,\fP \-\-format [gpx|tcx|kml|original]
[default: gpx]
.TP
\fB\-d,\fP \-\-out\-dir PATH
[default: activities]
.TP
\fB\-t,\fP \-\-type TEXT
.PP
